      "ruku": 348,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3406,
      "text": "showing their ingratitude to what We have given them and enjoy themselves, but they will soon come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 404,
      "ruku": 348,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3407,
      "text": "Do they not see that We have made [Makkah] a safe sanctuary, while people around them are being snatched away?[20] Do they still believe in falsehood[21] and show ingratitude to Allah’s favors?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 404,
      "ruku": 348,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3408,
      "text": "Who does greater wrong than one who fabricates lies against Allah or rejects the truth when it comes to him? Is there not a home in Hell for the disbelievers?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 404,
      "ruku": 348,
      "hizbQuarter": 161,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3409,
      "text": "As for those who strive in Our cause, We will surely guide them to Our ways[22], for Allah is certainly with those who do good.",
      "surah": {
